  "name": "Jins Bayati on G: G A1/2b Bb C D Eb",
  "notes": "Jins Bayati on G: G A1/2b Bb C D Eb -- a jins mask over the Rast 15-pitch tuning. Transposable (root-relative). || Cent values after Sami Abu Shumays' maqam presets for Ableton Live 12 (tuning.ableton.com/arabic-maqam). Egypt/Greater Syria practice, one practitioner's deeply-informed version -- NOT a universal standard. Maqam identity is melodic, not just the scale."
